          "Melanoma targeted option",
          "BRAF V600E status",
          "BRAF inhibitor is usually paired with MEK inhibitor."
        ],
        [
          "Breast cancer pathway",
          "HER2, hormone receptor, and BRCA status",
          "HER2-low and ADC categories complicate old binary rules."
        ],
